1
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,240
Then what if we use
the stomach contents to determine it?

2
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,270
We can only determine
how long after her last meal

3
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:15,560
she died.

4
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,440
But whether her last meal
was lunch or dinner

5
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,510
is impossible to know.

6
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,000
Then what do we do?

7
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,030
Let's wait
for the toxicology results first.

8
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,120
Hello, Jiang.

9
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:31,960
Captain.

10
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,640
Someone came forward with information
about Zheng Ling's case.

11
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:35,070
All right. I'm coming over now.

12
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:47,780
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 19=

13
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,880
It had to be that jerk Nie Yifeng

14
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:50,960
who caused Ms. Zheng's death.

15
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,030
He's a shameless, despicable pretty boy

16
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:54,070
who lives off women.

17
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:57,000
Calm down first. Have some water.

18
00:01:03,470 --> 00:01:05,120
Ms. Zheng
built her business from scratch.

19
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:07,560
She founded Jinyi Logistics herself.

20
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:08,840
Five years ago,

21
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,070
Nie Yifeng joined the company

22
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:11,400
and became Ms. Zheng's driver.

23
00:01:11,510 --> 00:01:13,070
That's how he got involved
with Ms. Zheng.

24
00:01:13,350 --> 00:01:14,920
After they got married,

25
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:15,920
Nie Yifeng became

26
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,640
the director
of our transportation department.

27
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:19,230
It was Nie Yifeng.

28
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,000
He made Ms. Zheng's life miserable.

29
00:01:45,590 --> 00:01:47,200
He was always fooling around
with other women.

30
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,950
It happened more than once.

31
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,310
But he knew how to sweet-talk her,

32
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,310
so Ms. Zheng never divorced him.

33
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,790
Until three years ago.

34
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,280
Feng.

35
00:01:55,730 --> 00:01:56,930
I heard last week

36
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,480
you brought in another investment
for our new project.

37
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:02,510
People insist on throwing money my way.

38
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:04,760
I can't stop them.

39
00:02:06,150 --> 00:02:06,870
Really?

40
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,560
But last time,
when it came to your wife,

41
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:10,840
you couldn't stop her.

42
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:16,080
Let her make a scene.

43
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,000
When I want to do something,

44
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,310
no one can stop me.

45
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,800
What about me?

46
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,840
Can you resist me?

47
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,280
That depends on

48
00:02:33,430 --> 00:02:34,750
how gentle you are.

49
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,910
How obedient I am

50
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,000
also depends on

51
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,640
how much more investment
you can bring in for me.

52
00:02:43,910 --> 00:02:45,120
What investment?

53
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:50,080
Let me hear about it.

54
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,910
Have I been too good to you?

55
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:58,960
Or did I

56
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,710
give you too high a credit limit?

57
00:03:05,590 --> 00:03:06,560
Or have I brought

58
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,360
too much investment

59
00:03:12,590 --> 00:03:13,910
into your projects?

60
00:03:20,150 --> 00:03:22,190
Notify every hotel in Longfan City.

61
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,680
Blacklist Nie Yifeng.

62
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,120
Yes.

63
00:03:26,630 --> 00:03:27,800
Starting today,

64
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:35,150
freeze all his bank cards

65
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:40,430
and withdraw all his investments.

66
00:03:45,150 --> 00:03:46,960
That must have been when

67
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:49,190
Nie Yifeng first decided
to kill Ms. Zheng.

68
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:52,520
Why didn't you
tell us this from the start?

69
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:55,870
With Ms. Zheng dead,

70
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:58,030
the company
will fall into Nie Yifeng's hands.

71
00:03:58,190 --> 00:04:00,430
I... I was afraid
he'd retaliate against me.

72
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:01,470
I didn't dare say anything.

73
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:03,840
But Ms. Zheng was really good to me.

74
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,150
She always hoped I could become

75
00:04:07,150 --> 00:04:08,470
as decisive and capable as she was.

76
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,310
It's just...

77
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,120
I don't understand.

78
00:04:11,590 --> 00:04:13,870
Ms. Zheng clearly deserved a better man.

79
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,040
Officer, it has to be Nie Yifeng.

80
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:17,270
Don't let him get away with it.

81
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,630
I went home alone that day.

82
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,070
After I got home,

83
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:25,920
I was just so bored.

84
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:29,430
Zheng Ling was completely
focused on her work,

85
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,070
and we didn't have any children.

86
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:34,430
Since I had nothing else to do,

87
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,040
I thought

88
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,070
I'd have a little fun.

89
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,070
Feng, why did you ask me
to come to your house?

90
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,630
What if your wife comes back?

91
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,750
She's away on a business trip.

92
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,430
Doesn't she think she's so powerful?

93
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:53,480
She made sure no hotel in Longfan City
would give me a room.

94
00:04:54,310 --> 00:04:55,120
Fine.

95
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,430
Then I'll bring someone home.

96
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,160
You have no idea
how much she loves that bed.

97
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:03,430
And I'm going to use her favorite bed

98
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:06,480
to do something she'd hate the most.

99
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:13,630
A ghost!

100
00:05:16,870 --> 00:05:17,680
Wait.

101
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,920
What are you doing?

102
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,950
Feng, I'm calling the police.

103
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:20,680
We have to call the police.

104
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,360
Otherwise...

105
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,920
Otherwise, how are we
going to explain this?

106
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,430
How are we going to explain this?

107
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:26,680
If we explain what happened here,

108
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,480
how are we going to explain
what happened between us?

109
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,920
Do you really want everyone

110
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,240
to know about us?

111
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,070
If word gets out,

112
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:35,800
it won't be good for you either, right?

113
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,830
Come on.

114
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Get dressed and leave first.

115
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,870
Hurry. You go first.

116
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:45,390
I'll take care of the rest, okay?

117
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:46,240
Wait.

118
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:47,830
You...

119
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:49,600
Use the back door. It's safer.

120
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,160
Hurry.

121
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,360
That's what happened.

122
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,240
I... I haven't hidden anything from you.

123
00:05:57,310 --> 00:05:59,120
But it was all consensual.

124
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,510
Zheng Ling knew about it too.

125
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,270
Didn't she just turn a blind eye to it?

126
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:06,240
But I thought
she didn't care about any of this.

127
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,120
Why would she

128
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,120
kill herself

129
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:10,190
over something like this?

130
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,360
Could... Could she

131
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,160
have wanted

132
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,160
to use this to get back at me?

133
00:06:16,510 --> 00:06:17,310
Suicide?

134
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,040
You think it was suicide?

135
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:23,160
You never thought about killing her?

136
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,390
Officer,

137
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,870
you may not understand our relationship.

138
00:06:27,870 --> 00:06:30,240
I... I depended entirely
on her financially.

139
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,830
She was my biggest source of money.

140
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,240
My car, my house,

141
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,720
didn't she pay for all of it?

142
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,870
Why would I kill her?

143
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,480
Wouldn't I have to be crazy?

144
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,310
Without her,

145
00:06:38,310 --> 00:06:39,680
I'd have nothing.

146
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,270
What's the woman's name?

147
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:47,120
Jiang Xueyan.

148
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,830
I don't know Zheng Ling at all.

149
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,510
That was also my first time
at Nie Yifeng's house.

150
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,680
I'm still so shaken

151
00:06:55,270 --> 00:06:57,360
that I can still see
that scene before my eyes.

152
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,560
How long have you known Nie Yifeng?

153
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:04,360
We met at a bar a month ago.

154
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,240
He was well-dressed

155
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,950
and generous with money,

156
00:07:08,430 --> 00:07:10,270
so I thought he was worth seeing.

157
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,160
He didn't hide anything from me either.

158
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:14,720
He told me
he had a wife as soon as we met.

159
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,510
I know

160
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:19,160
Nie Yifeng was only having fun with me.

161
00:07:19,950 --> 00:07:21,950
His wife was the one he truly loved.

162
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:25,120
I guess it was just his male pride.

163
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,190
His wife embarrassed him in public,

164
00:07:28,830 --> 00:07:31,040
so this was his way
of getting back at her.

165
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,750
I'm a victim too.

166
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:38,560
I need to see a therapist now.

167
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:41,000
Every time I close my eyes,

168
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,870
I see that scene.

169
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:43,720
I'm too scared to sleep at all.

170
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:52,600
The toxicology report is out.

171
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,190
(Forensic Toxicology Report)
In the victim's heart blood,

172
00:07:54,190 --> 00:07:56,120
we only found clozapine,
which she had been taking long-term.

173
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,830
No other toxic substances were detected.

174
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,160
Could she really have killed herself?

175
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,000
These aren't pressure marks
from a bracelet.

176
00:08:11,630 --> 00:08:12,600
They're restraint injuries.

177
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:15,870
The marks are very narrow,

178
00:08:15,950 --> 00:08:17,120
and the skin folds are evenly spaced.

179
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:19,070
That means the binding material
was elastic and not very rigid.

180
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,040
Something like

181
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,630
a thick rubber band.

182
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:23,680
Did you find
anything like that at the scene?

183
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,510
No.

184
00:08:24,630 --> 00:08:26,560
And if she was restrained,

185
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,750
suicide would
be much less likely, right?

186
00:08:29,270 --> 00:08:31,120
With her hands and feet tied,

187
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,750
she couldn't have hanged herself.

188
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:33,630
But there were

189
00:08:33,630 --> 00:08:35,630
no signs of struggle on her body.

190
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,720
No one would just let themselves
be strangled to death.

191
00:08:39,510 --> 00:08:40,440
Let me ask her.

192
00:08:55,270 --> 00:08:56,550
Apart from congestion
and other signs of asphyxia,

193
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:58,630
none of the victim's organs
showed any other abnormalities.

194
00:08:58,630 --> 00:08:59,890
(Circular Marks, Restraint Injuries)
There were no other abnormalities.

195
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:01,200
There were no injuries
to the head either.

196
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,390
(Longfan Public Security)
This further confirms

197
00:09:02,630 --> 00:09:03,960
that the cause of death
was antemortem hanging.

198
00:09:04,550 --> 00:09:05,550
But here's the key.

199
00:09:05,870 --> 00:09:07,670
(Undigested Food in the Stomach)
Her stomach was full of undigested food.

200
00:09:07,790 --> 00:09:09,750
The contents were exactly the same

201
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:10,630
as the food found in the kitchen.

202
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:11,360
This indicates

203
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,120
that the victim
died within an hour after eating.

204
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,030
But we still can't determine

205
00:09:15,030 --> 00:09:17,080
whether that meal was lunch or dinner.

206
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,200
No toxic substances
were found in the food.

207
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,030
But in that bowl of millet porridge,

208
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:22,510
we found clozapine.

209
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,440
The victim couldn't have

210
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,480
mixed her pills
into the porridge before taking them.

211
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,600
Could that mean someone drugged her?

212
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:31,030
Based on the forensic
and laboratory test results,

213
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,870
we can basically
reconstruct what happened.

214
00:09:41,390 --> 00:09:42,670
Clozapine doesn't dissolve in water.

215
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,200
But if the powder
is mixed into porridge,

216
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,320
it won't affect the taste

217
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,480
and is difficult to detect.

218
00:09:46,870 --> 00:09:48,440
That would be
an effective way to drug someone.

219
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,600
Being able to eat with her at home

220
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,670
suggests the killer
was very close to Zheng Ling.

221
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,270
And the killer likely knew

222
00:09:54,270 --> 00:09:56,030
that the victim had
been taking clozapine long-term,

223
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,910
so they used her regular medication

224
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:58,910
to make her fall asleep.

225
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:20,790
Look at these marks on the window frame.

226
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:22,080
If she had hanged herself,

227
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,670
the marks should only run downward.

228
00:10:23,670 --> 00:10:25,120
But the marks at the scene show

229
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,550
that the body was pulled upward

230
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:28,030
and then lowered.

231
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:28,870
Taking all this into account,

232
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:29,960
we believe it was homicide.

233
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,510
This is a murder case.

234
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:34,670
And they were able
to eat together at her home.

235
00:10:35,030 --> 00:10:36,360
It was an ordinary home-cooked meal,

236
00:10:36,870 --> 00:10:39,360
and the victim
was even wearing loungewear.

237
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,750
That suggests the killer
was someone she knew,

238
00:10:40,750 --> 00:10:43,750
and someone extremely close to her.

239
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,550
There were also three pairs
of slippers at the scene.

240
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:46,480
That means...

241
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,480
Could it have been Nie Yifeng, Qin?

242
00:10:48,750 --> 00:10:50,000
He avoided the security cameras

243
00:10:50,550 --> 00:10:51,630
and secretly returned to the complex.

244
00:10:51,870 --> 00:10:53,080
He also had a motive.

245
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,750
The three pairs
of slippers had footprints from

246
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:56,960
him, Zheng Ling, and Jiang Xueyan.

247
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:57,840
So

248
00:10:58,390 --> 00:11:00,000
the prime suspect in Zheng Ling's case

249
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:01,510
is her husband, Nie Yifeng.

250
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:02,750
It probably wasn't Nie Yifeng.

251
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,320
Considering all the details,

252
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:05,840
the drugging, the restraints,

253
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,360
the way the scene was staged,

254
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:09,510
how comfortable
the victim was around the killer,

255
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:11,360
and the close,
familiar atmosphere in the home,

256
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,670
the killer was probably not Nie Yifeng,

257
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,550
but a woman.

258
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:23,240
Qin, what are you basing that on?

259
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,840
Because physical evidence doesn't lie.

260
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,480
If he had done it,

261
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,600
with his strength,

262
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:29,120
he could have easily hanged her.

263
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,630
The window frame
would only have downward marks.

264
00:11:32,270 --> 00:11:33,630
But the marks at the scene show

265
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,270
that the body was repeatedly pulled

266
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:36,550
and then slipped back down.

267
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:38,270
That indicates a lack of strength

268
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,670
and difficulty in carrying it out.

269
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:40,870
This means

270
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,390
the killer had great difficulty

271
00:11:42,670 --> 00:11:44,630
dragging an unconscious woman

272
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:45,670
weighing 45 kilograms.

273
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:48,320
Second, if it were Nie Yifeng,

274
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,550
he could have acted immediately
after drugging her.

275
00:11:50,670 --> 00:11:52,750
Tying her up would only
increase the risk of exposure.

276
00:11:53,550 --> 00:11:54,840
And thick rubber bands like these

277
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,750
are generally used to tie up hair.

278
00:11:56,910 --> 00:11:58,630
But none were found
in the victim's home,

279
00:11:58,870 --> 00:12:00,510
which means they didn't belong to her.

280
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:03,000
The killer brought them
and took them away afterward.

281
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:03,910
There's one more thing.

282
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:05,720
Because the victim's hands
and feet were tied,

283
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,750
when the drug wore off,

284
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,390
she couldn't put up much of a struggle.

285
00:12:08,750 --> 00:12:10,670
There were no scratch marks
on her neck either.

286
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,960
After the victim died,

287
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:12,960
cadaveric spasm

288
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,670
preserved her wide-eyed expression.

289
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,750
If the crime
had been carried out quickly,

290
00:12:17,150 --> 00:12:19,000
the victim wouldn't
have had a chance to wake up.

291
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,000
This shows

292
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,790
the entire process was difficult

293
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:22,550
for the killer to carry out.

294
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:23,390
Putting all of this together,

295
00:12:23,390 --> 00:12:25,360
we now have
a very clear profile of the killer.

296
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:27,120
Someone close to the victim,

297
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:27,910
with limited physical strength,

298
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:29,240
a woman who could freely enter

299
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,720
the victim's home,

300
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,600
used her knowledge
of the victim's daily habits

301
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,630
and regular medication

302
00:12:33,630 --> 00:12:34,750
to plan this murder.

303
00:12:36,870 --> 00:12:38,200
Start investigating immediately
along those lines.

304
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:41,120
Look into the women
in the victim's social circle,

305
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,600
especially those close to her.

306
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:43,510
Yes.

307
00:12:46,870 --> 00:12:48,320
Ms. Zheng started
her business at a young age

308
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,000
and had little contact with her family.

309
00:12:50,030 --> 00:12:51,200
They weren't very close.

310
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,320
By comparison,

311
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,670
she had more contact
with her second sister, Zheng Jing.

312
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,440
But after one incident

313
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,960
when the sisters
had a heated argument at the company,

314
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,750
their relationship quickly deteriorated.

315
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,960
Ling, she's our eldest sister.

316
00:13:04,550 --> 00:13:06,840
You weren't
even eight when Dad disappeared.

317
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:09,480
She was the one who raised you.

318
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:12,790
She worked day and night to support you

319
00:13:12,870 --> 00:13:14,240
and gave up the chance
to attend a top high school.

320
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,670
She worked herself to the bone,

321
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:16,750
and now she has terminal cancer.

322
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:18,320
How can you just turn your back on her?

323
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,550
I've given this family
plenty of financial help

324
00:13:19,550 --> 00:13:20,840
over the years.

325
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,240
When our eldest sister had her baby,

326
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,080
when you got married,

327
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,720
when did I ever refuse to contribute?

328
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:28,840
I've repaid everything
I owed this family.

329
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,960
Now you're asking me for 300,000 yuan.

330
00:13:32,510 --> 00:13:33,960
Do you think I print money?

331
00:13:34,670 --> 00:13:35,320
Besides,

332
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,840
our eldest sister's illness
can't be cured anyway.

333
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:37,960
It can be cured.

334
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:40,510
If you give her the money,

335
00:13:40,510 --> 00:13:41,790
she might get better.

336
00:13:41,790 --> 00:13:42,510
It can't be cured!

337
00:13:42,510 --> 00:13:43,790
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

338
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,550
The doctor said it's incurable.
The cancer has spread to multiple sites.

339
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,600
We should just let our eldest sister

340
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,390
live out the rest of her days in peace.

341
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,000
Stop putting her through all this.

342
00:13:58,790 --> 00:14:00,080
You just don't want
to spend the money, right?

343
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,790
You run such a big company.

344
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:04,510
What is this amount of money to you?

345
00:14:06,150 --> 00:14:08,270
Do I have to get
on my knees and beg you?

346
00:14:12,510 --> 00:14:14,080
Zheng Ling, she's

347
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,360
your own sister who raised you.

348
00:14:16,630 --> 00:14:18,390
Are you really going
to stand by and let her die?

349
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:21,790
Our eldest sister's husband
drinks and beats her all the time.

350
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:25,080
He made her so miserable
that she ended up with cancer.

351
00:14:25,270 --> 00:14:26,200
And what about your husband?

352
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:28,030
You two wanted a child so badly.

353
00:14:28,390 --> 00:14:30,030
How many eggs
did he force you to have retrieved?

354
00:14:30,790 --> 00:14:32,150
How much money did the two of you spend?

355
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:34,120
I've told you before.

356
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,440
You and our eldest sister

357
00:14:35,550 --> 00:14:37,150
have always been too softhearted.

358
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:39,150
That's why neither of you
has ever had a good life.

359
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,440
What did you say?

360
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,670
You're the only one
living a good life, right?

361
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:44,440
Without our eldest sister,

362
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,240
you'd be nothing.

363
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:47,720
You're heartless.

364
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,670
You're so coldhearted.

365
00:14:48,670 --> 00:14:51,200
Madam, it's not that
Ms. Zheng doesn't want to pay.

366
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,360
It's just that
our company's cash flow really...

367
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,200
Stay out of this.

368
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,150
This is a family matter.
It's none of your business!

369
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,000
Stop acting crazy, Zheng Jing.

370
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,390
When the old house was demolished,

371
00:14:58,390 --> 00:15:00,150
you and our eldest sister
got the larger shares, didn't you?

372
00:15:00,910 --> 00:15:02,120
I got the smaller share.

373
00:15:03,030 --> 00:15:04,550
I didn't say a word
about it back then, did I?

374
00:15:05,270 --> 00:15:05,910
All these years,

375
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,480
have you ever counted how much money

376
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,670
I've given this family?

377
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:10,670
From now on,
I don't want to deal with any of this.

378
00:15:11,510 --> 00:15:13,240
I just want to live my own life.

379
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:15,000
So stop trying to guilt me into it.

380
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,270
If you two still want to be my sisters,

381
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:18,030
then be my sisters.

382
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,120
If you don't,

383
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,440
then I don't have any sisters.

384
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,750
Don't come to my company again.

385
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:29,600
(Zheng Ling.)

386
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,840
(You'll pay for your ingratitude)

387
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,000
(one day.)

388
00:15:39,550 --> 00:15:44,070
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

389
00:15:47,110 --> 00:15:51,910
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

390
00:15:54,630 --> 00:15:59,990
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

391
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:05,870
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

392
00:16:07,870 --> 00:16:15,830
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

393
00:16:16,470 --> 00:16:21,510
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

394
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:31,870
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

395
00:16:31,870 --> 00:16:37,710
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

396
00:16:39,190 --> 00:16:47,310
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

397
00:16:47,990 --> 00:16:53,030
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

398
00:16:54,830 --> 00:17:02,870
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

399
00:17:03,150 --> 00:17:10,390
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

400
00:17:10,590 --> 00:17:15,030
♪Can you hear me?♪

401
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:18,830
♪Can you hear me?♪

402
00:17:18,830 --> 00:17:26,270
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

403
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:34,030
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

404
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:39,950
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

405
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:45,430
♪After all these years♪

406
00:17:47,950 --> 00:17:55,430
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

407
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:57,630
♪And tell you♪

408
00:17:58,830 --> 00:18:02,110
♪I haven't let you down♪
